Builder.io (Visual Copilot + Visual Editor/Fusion): what it actually is

Builder.io is best thought of as an AI-powered visual development platform (not just a “design tool”). It tries to unify:
	1.	Design→code automation (Visual Copilot / Figma-to-code)
	2.	Visual building & iteration on top of a real codebase (Visual Editor / Fusion)
	3.	Publish workflow (CMS-like) iteration, personalization, A/B variants—often without engineering round-trips

Their own Visual Editor 3.0 framing is explicitly “design + AI + seamless code integration,” including a CLI that analyzes your stack and maps outputs into your repo.  ￼

